{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2023-02-24 10:27:00', 'title': 'CRYSTAL GROUP ADDS SPEED, DENSITY AND MEMORY TO COMPUTE SOLUTIONS WITH LATEST GENERATION INTEL XEON® SCALABLE PROCESSOR', 'text': 'HIAWATHA, IOWA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CRYSTAL GROUP, INC., THE MOST TRUSTED DESIGNER AND MANUFACTURER OF RUGGED HIGH-PERFORMANCE EDGE COMPUTE SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE INTEGRATION OF THE 4TH GENERATION INTEL® XEON® SCALABLE PROCESSOR (CODE NAMED SAPPHIRE RAPIDS) INTO THEIR PORTFOLIO OF RUGGED HARDWARE.'}